<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian stocks end at record closing high.</title>
<headline>Australian stocks end at record closing high.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------(Snapshot 4.10 p.m./0610 GMT)----------------</p>
<p>AORD cl	    2681.7   +12.4   DJIA cl	7772.09    -9.95</p>
<p>SPI Sycom cl     2689.0   +11.0   US 30yr cl	6.69    -0.03</p>
<p>10yrbond futs    92.915  -0.055   Gold NY 342.65 Lon fix 341.50</p>
<p>AUD    US$0.7475  (Mon $0.7512)   CRB Index cl  243.53    -0.92</p>
<p>NIKKEI	  20,593.66  -87.41   FTSE cl	 4745.1    -38.0</p>
